### Moazez Dashboard API Tests
### Compatible with VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client.
### Fill in accessToken with a School Admin or Organization Admin token in an active school scope.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@todoId = REPLACE_AFTER_CREATE
@academicYearId = REPLACE_OPTIONALLY
@termId = REPLACE_OPTIONALLY
@gradeId = REPLACE_OPTIONALLY
@sectionId = REPLACE_OPTIONALLY
@classroomId = REPLACE_OPTIONALLY

### 1. Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2. Alerts - default non-zero
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Alerts - all Attendance signals, including zeros
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/alerts?source=attendance&includeZeroCount=true&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Activity feed
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity-feed?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Activity feed filtered
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity-feed?source=attendance&actorType=admin&eventType=attendance.session.submit&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Command Center
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/command-center
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Light Mode Dropdown - Cairo selected day
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/light-mode-dropdown?locale=en&timezone=Africa%2FCairo&units=metric&date=2026-07-15
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Widgets - all
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/widgets?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. Widgets - analytics mini charts only
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/widgets?type=mini-chart-card&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. Widget detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/widgets/attendance.daily_trend
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. Calendar widget detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/widgets/calendar.today
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Modules list
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/modules?status=available&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Attendance module page
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/modules/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. Analytics catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/catalog
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 15. Analytics chart definitions
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/charts?status=available&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 16. Chart definition
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/charts/attendance.absence_rate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 17. Attendance daily trend - fixed 30 days
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/charts/attendance.daily_trend/data?range=30d&granularity=day
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 18. Attendance absence rate - custom window
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/charts/attendance.absence_rate/data?range=custom&granularity=day&dateFrom=2026-07-01&dateTo=2026-07-15
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 19. Student enrollment growth
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/charts/students.enrollment_growth/data?range=90d&granularity=week
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 20. Admissions application status
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/charts/admissions.applications_by_status/data?range=30d&granularity=day
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 21. Teacher allocation coverage with optional hierarchy
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/charts/academics.teacher_allocation_coverage/data?range=30d&granularity=day
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 22. Gradebook completion - requires valid academic context in many datasets
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/charts/grades.gradebook_completion/data?range=30d&granularity=day&academicYearId={{academicYearId}}&termId={{termId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 23. Homework submission/review trend
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/charts/homework.submission_review_trend/data?range=30d&granularity=day
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 24. Behavior positive/negative trend
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/charts/behavior.positive_negative_trend/data?range=30d&granularity=day
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 25. Reinforcement reward redemption funnel
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/charts/reinforcement.reward_redemption_status/data?range=30d&granularity=day
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 26. Communication message volume
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/charts/communication.message_volume/data?range=30d&granularity=day
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 27. Definition-only chart - must return safe not-implemented data state
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/charts/admissions.funnel/data?range=30d&granularity=day
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 28. List Todos
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/light-mode-dropdown/todos?date=2026-07-15&status=all&limit=100&timezone=Africa%2FCairo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 29. Create Todo
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/light-mode-dropdown/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-07-15",
  "title": "Review pending Dashboard actions",
  "notes": "Created from dashboard-api-tests.http",
  "priority": "high",
  "sortOrder": 10
}

### 30. Update Todo - set completed
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/light-mode-dropdown/todos/{{todoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "completed",
  "priority": "normal"
}

### 31. Update Todo - set pending and clear notes
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/light-mode-dropdown/todos/{{todoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "pending",
  "notes": null
}

### 32. Delete Todo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/light-mode-dropdown/todos/{{todoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Negative 1. Unknown widget -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/widgets/not.a.real.widget
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Negative 2. Unknown module -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/modules/not-a-real-module
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Negative 3. Unknown chart -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/charts/not.a.real.chart/data
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Negative 4. Invalid activity cursor -> validation error
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity-feed?cursor=not-a-valid-cursor
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Negative 5. Invalid date range -> validation error
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity-feed?dateFrom=2026-07-15T00:00:00.000Z&dateTo=2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Negative 6. dateFrom/dateTo with non-custom Analytics range -> validation error
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/analytics/charts/attendance.daily_trend/data?range=30d&dateFrom=2026-07-01&dateTo=2026-07-15
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Negative 7. Empty Todo PATCH -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/light-mode-dropdown/todos/{{todoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}

### Negative 8. Invalid Todo title -> validation error
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/light-mode-dropdown/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-07-15",
  "title": "",
  "priority": "urgent"
}
